{160}{Excuse me? [She seems surprised]. You haven't even dealt with the Mummy yet? Well then, in that case... The City of Grayhills will not pay you UNTIL such time as you have dealt with the Mummy. Should you meet an unfortunate end during your adventure, then I'm sure that the City of Grayhills will gladly make funeral arrangements for you. Good day.}{Excuse me? [She seems surprised]. You haven't even dealt with the Mummy yet? Well then, in that case... The City of Grayhills will not pay you UNTIL such time as you have dealt with the Mummy. Should you meet an unfortunate end during your adventure, then I'm sure that the City of Grayhills will gladly make funeral arrangements for you. Good day.}{}{}{}{}
